{"id":"vod_zy360_65891","vodId":"65891","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"食戟之灵","name_cn":"食戟之灵","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全24集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241016-1/384c061503e5dc38a5287d261dfceafc.jpg"},"summary":"幸平创真（松冈祯丞配音）出生于料理世家，其父经营着一间家庭餐馆，小小年纪的幸平即将父亲当做了榜样，发誓成为父亲那样的料理家。某一日，父亲找到了幸平，希望他能够进入顶级的料理学校“远月学园”深造磨练，背负着父亲的期许，幸平踏上了旅程。在学校里，幸平结识了名为薙切绘里奈（种田梨沙配音）的少女，这位传说中拥有“神之舌”的傲娇少女，竟然将幸平所作的料理判定为“不合格”。外表热情开朗内心极有城府的一色慧（樱井孝宏配音）、拥有孱弱身体和强大头脑的丸井善二（小林裕介配音）、活泼开朗的吉野悠姬（内田真礼配音），与这些“同行”交流着，竞争着，幸平还有很长的路要走。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-16 14:45:59","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/RBtDp4yM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/LSobEyL2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/W4mvrSd0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/odsCNQhm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/tYTx2fub/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/lnuM05el/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/MlWHoAxt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/tVdfe8oR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/4aGCvcPh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/QZtu0eTt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/DEtKwInq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/9ymVSKDk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/UUv7YGUY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/WA6O36wJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241015/QIdCagxP/index.m3u8"},